{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "5d8abc38-676f-84f5-9556-78c01a92473d",
  "created_at": "2026-01-29T10:10:49-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Okafor",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:08:44-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:08:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, good morning. I'm calling because the plow knocked over my mailbox. It's lying flat on the ground, the post and everything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:08:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. Let me get some details. What's the address where it happened?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:02-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 240 Annandale Road, in the North End. The mailbox is right at the curb in front of the house."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:09-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 240 Annandale Road. And when did this happen, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:14-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It was after the storm, the one with the snow and then the rain, that ended Monday. So three days ago. I saw it Monday morning when I went out. No way it fell by itself, the plow marks are right there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the mailbox was knocked down during or right after that snow-to-rain storm, and it's the post that came down too, not just the box."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the whole thing. The post is cracked at the bottom. The mail carrier cannot put anything in it, so I'm going to the post office now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's a hassle, I understand. I'll write this up for the highway crew so someone can look at it and see what the city can do. Can I get a good number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:56-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's 401-555-0181."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:09:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-one. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:01-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:02-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Aisha. I've got it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when will it be cleared? I mean, when will somebody come to look, or fix it? The pieces are in the snowbank and I don't want people to trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say someone should contact you within a few business days, maybe sooner. Crews are still catching up from the storm. If you can, move the broken pieces back off the curb in the meantime."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I can do that. My brother lives overseas, and I tell him everything, so he will hear about this call tonight. He will say, did they fix it yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I hope we'll have an answer for him. I have your report for 240 Annandale Road, mailbox knocked down by the plow, and your number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:45-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thank you very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-29T10:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care."
    }
  ],
